ge  the president promised the people of  pennsylvania in america that  that he would appoint but uh look you  know but  chuck schumer saying he's not even going  to meet with judge barrett  all the obfuscation uh notwithstanding  we we have every confidence that uh  when when the american people come to  know better and better this  extraordinary judge  when their hearing approaches they're  going to see the wisdom of president  trump's  choice and when it comes to health care  brett i i hope it does come up tonight  you know i think the 2016 election was  in so many ways a rejection  of obamacare i mean remember the when  joe biden was vice president they  promised that  you like your health insurance you can  keep it if you like your doctor you  can keep it uh they said that that  insurance premiums would go down none of  those things were true  one uh one outlet actually called it the  biggest lie of the last 10 years  well ever since president trump's been  working to lower prescription drugs  we've been creating new insurance models  the president's made it clear with  recent  executive action that we're going to  protect americans with pre-existing  conditions  but we're going to stay committed to  repealing and replacing obamacare and  giving the american people  great health care that respects the  doctor-patient relationship that's built  on free  market principles and doesn't put us on  an inexorable pathway  to socialized medicine which ultimately  is where  we're going to get into all that all  that tonight i just have a few more  seconds  mr vice president i want to talk to you  briefly about your preparation  we understand governor scott walker  former governor of wisconsin is your  prep partner playing kamala harris on  the other side  uh mayor pete buda judge is playing you  uh he's coming up on our show do you  have a message for him  about his preparation  uh well my message about next week's  debate  is i'm just counting the days it's an  incredible privilege for me to be vice  president to president donald trump  to have the chance to take the national  stage in salt lake city next week and  really lay out  what we've done but also lay out the  choice the american people face  i mean in the middle of a global  pandemic joe biden  and kamala harris want to raise taxes by  4 trillion dollars they  they want to stifle american energy in  the american energy renaissance that's  created  thousands of jobs in places like here in  pennsylvania they want to they want to  have an  activist court once again legislating  from the bench  i'm going to lay out that case i'm going  to lay out that choice  but tonight it's all about president  donald trump and  i know he's going to take our case to  the american people and  he's going to take the message straight  to joe biden i can't wait to see it  all right mr vice president we  appreciate your time from pennsylvania  we'll pass that on to mayor pete in a  bit

